    <div class="sol-header">
      <div class="sol-number">Solution 01</div>
      <h2 class="sol-name">nohup</h2>
      <p class="sol-tagline">最简方案。忽略 SIGHUP 信号,保证程序后台运行。适合非交互式任务。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nohup-grid">
      <div class="code-block">
        <div class="code-header">
          <span class="code-lang">bash</span>
